{"c":[{"name":"20261006T114711Z-5f2b276e7a41de4a","text":"Fill joins require the same trigger and ordered selectedFormInputs: descriptor admission can omit different fields even when input sets match. Different triggers wait with their own captured identity.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T132506Z-afeea7cd00f9f436","text":"H13: with-heavy refuses unless free disk minus your --est-disk stays >= 8 GiB, so at about 10 GiB free a 2 GiB build waits; ask for the smallest honest estimate (harness build 3 mem / 2 disk), and swap growth on this Mac eats the same disk.","type":"note"}]}
